{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39649214",
      "title": "Passing Custom Arguments to Event Functions",
      "sourceHash": "0dcb1dac58bdc0e70d14992803d29dbd3409573607c85023b6a1401accf7c68b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.68,
          "en": "So now that we're able to, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "listen to clicks on our custom button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 10.62,
          "en": "we now wanna replace dynamic content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.62,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "with some different content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 16.293,
          "en": "depending on which button was clicked here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 19.05,
          "en": "And for that, as a start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.05,
          "end": 22.71,
          "en": "we'll need to know which button was clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.71,
          "end": 26.07,
          "en": "So therefore, here in this handleSelect function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.07,
          "end": 30.173,
          "en": "we might want to accept a parameter, selectedButton maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 37.03,
          "en": "And our idea here could be that selectedButton",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 42.4,
          "en": "should be a string that's either components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 45.87,
          "en": "if the components button was clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.87,
          "end": 49.413,
          "en": "JSX if the JSX button was clicked, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.61,
          "end": 55.447,
          "en": "So therefore here, this is components, JSX, props, or state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "These could be our four identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "that should be received through that parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "So depending on which button was clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 71.13,
          "en": "selectedButton should be one of these four values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.13,
          "end": 73.5,
          "en": "And then in here we could use a if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 77.163,
          "en": "to replace this dynamic content appropriately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 80.91,
          "en": "Well therefore, we'll of course have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 80.91,
          "end": 85.32,
          "en": "that we do pass the appropriate identifier to handleSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 85.32,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "based on which button was tapped here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "And by default, when just passing handleSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 93.997,
          "en": "as a value to onSelect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 93.997,
          "end": 96.21000000000001,
          "en": "And therefore, in the end to this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.21000000000001,
          "end": 100.71000000000001,
          "en": "on this onClick prop, we won't get that identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 100.71000000000001,
          "end": 103.59,
          "en": "because that's some logic that's specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 103.59,
          "end": 105.36,
          "en": "to our application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.36,
          "end": 108.57,
          "en": "and of course, React doesn't know that we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 108.57,
          "end": 111.663,
          "en": "such an identifier when that button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "What we'll have to do, therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "is we'll have to control how handleSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "will be executed by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "And we can do this by,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "instead of pointing at this handle select function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 130.71,
          "en": "So instead of using that as a value for onSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.71,
          "end": 134.313,
          "en": "we can pass an arrow function to onSelect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.33,
          "end": 138.42000000000002,
          "en": "So now instead of just passing handleSelect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 138.42000000000002,
          "end": 143.313,
          "en": "I'm passing this arrow function as a value to onSelect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 144.69,
          "end": 148.05,
          "en": "And this is of course a standard JavaScript feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 148.05,
          "end": 150.09,
          "en": "not exclusive to React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 150.09,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "You can create anonymous arrow functions like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 155.163,
          "en": "using this syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 159.42000000000002,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could also create an anonymous function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.42000000000002,
          "end": 163.53,
          "en": "like this and execute handleSelect in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 163.53,
          "end": 166.62,
          "en": "But this arrow function syntax is simply a bit shorter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 168.32999999999998,
          "en": "hence I'll go for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.32999999999998,
          "end": 172.71,
          "en": "And what this code will do is it will now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.71,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "that this anonymous arrow function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 179.46,
          "en": "is now actually the value that's passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 182.763,
          "en": "to onSelect, and therefore in the end also to onClick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 184.17,
          "end": 186.72,
          "en": "And hence, we can now write code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186.72,
          "end": 189.51,
          "en": "inside of this arrow function body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.51,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "So on the right side of this arrow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 193.05,
          "en": "that will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.05,
          "end": 196.14,
          "en": "when this anonymous function will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 197.97,
          "en": "And therefore, here, we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.97,
          "end": 200.97,
          "en": "and should now execute handleSelect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.97,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "because this code will now not run immediately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.03,
          "end": 207.03,
          "en": "when this line of code gets parsed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 209.28,
          "en": "Instead, when that line of code gets parsed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.28,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "it's just this arrow function that will be defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 214.98,
          "en": "not the code inside of the arrow function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.98,
          "end": 217.2,
          "en": "that will be executed yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.2,
          "end": 219.51,
          "en": "And this arrow function is then passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.51,
          "end": 222.69,
          "en": "to the tap button on this onSelect prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.69,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "And therefore, when this function is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 227.22,
          "en": "because the button was clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.22,
          "end": 230.79,
          "en": "it's then that this code inside of the arrow function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.79,
          "end": 232.203,
          "en": "will get executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.34,
          "end": 236.34,
          "en": "And therefore, now here we can execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.34,
          "end": 239.55,
          "en": "handleSelect manually and we can control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.55,
          "end": 241.2,
          "en": "how it will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.2,
          "end": 242.16,
          "en": "And for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.16,
          "end": 245.763,
          "en": "pass this components string identifier to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.2,
          "end": 252.2,
          "en": "And we can now use this code here for all these tab buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 256.68,
          "en": "and pass different identifiers to handleSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.68,
          "end": 259.173,
          "en": "based on which button was pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.16,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "And this is therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 264.12,
          "en": "a very common pattern that's used in React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264.12,
          "end": 267,
          "en": "if you wanna define a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267,
          "end": 269.67,
          "en": "that should be executed upon an event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.67,
          "end": 273.45,
          "en": "but you also want to control how it's going to be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 273.45,
          "end": 277.89,
          "en": "and which arguments are going to be passed to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 277.89,
          "end": 278.97,
          "en": "And therefore, with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.97,
          "end": 281.76,
          "en": "we can now go up to handleSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 281.76,
          "end": 286.76,
          "en": "and maybe output the selected button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 288.42,
          "end": 291.54,
          "en": "so that we can see whether we get different values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 293.76,
          "en": "for different buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 293.76,
          "end": 298.76,
          "en": "And if we save this, go back and open the developer tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 299.90999999999997,
          "end": 302.82,
          "en": "If I press those different buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 302.82,
          "end": 306.81,
          "en": "you see on the right that different values get locked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 306.81,
          "end": 308.103,
          "en": "to the console here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 309.36,
          "end": 311.1,
          "en": "So this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 311.1,
          "end": 315.39,
          "en": "And with that we now get our custom identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.39,
          "end": 320.39,
          "en": "our custom parameter, in this eventHandling function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 320.4,
          "end": 323.25,
          "en": "And with that, we now got everything we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 323.25,
          "end": 327.81,
          "en": "to now finally replace dynamic content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 327.81,
          "end": 329.76,
          "en": "this place holder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 329.76,
          "end": 333,
          "en": "with the actual content that should be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 333,
          "end": 335.013,
          "en": "based on which button was pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}